# Package-scoped development

This is a monorepo under `packages/`. When the task fits one domain, work only in that package tree and follow its `AGENTS.md`.

- Platform → `packages/hiveflow-platform`
- Connectors → `packages/hiveflow-connectors`
- Lake → `packages/hiveflow-lake`
- DNA engine → `packages/hiveflow-dna`
- Portal UI → `packages/hiveflow-portal`
- Full CDK / cross-cutting → repo root

Do not pull in `../hiveflow-business` or other sibling Analytics Business repos unless the user explicitly asks.

Hard dependency rule: `hiveflow.dna` must never import `hiveflow.dna.web`.
